---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';

import session01 from '../assets/session_01.jpg';
import session02 from '../assets/session_02.jpg';
import session03 from '../assets/session_03.jpg';
import session04 from '../assets/session_04.jpg';
import session05 from '../assets/session_05.jpg';
import session06 from '../assets/session_06.jpg';

const images = [
  { src: session01, alt: 'Studio session' },
  { src: session02, alt: 'Recording take' },
  { src: session03, alt: 'Behind the scenes' },
  { src: session04, alt: 'Keys & rhythm' },
  { src: session05, alt: 'Brass overdubs' },
  { src: session06, alt: 'Control room' },
];
---

<section id="bio" class="relative py-20 md:py-28 overflow-hidden">

  <!-- Ambient glows -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute -top-40 right-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-15"
      style="background: radial-gradient(closest-side, var(--accent-secondary), transparent)"></div>
    <div class="absolute -bottom-40 left-0 w-[600px] h-[600px] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-15"
      style="background: radial-gradient(closest-side, var(--accent-blue), transparent)"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="relative container-max px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-20">

    <!-- Section header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-14 reveal">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Our Story</span>
      <h2 class="font-playfair text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-white mb-3 leading-tight">
        It started at home.<br/>
        <em class="gradient-text not-italic">It didn't stay there.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Layout: testo a sinistra, carosello a destra -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Origin story text -->
      <div class="bio-text reveal" style="animation-delay: 0.1s">

        <!-- Origin paragraph -->
        <p class="bio-para bio-para--lead">
          It started in <strong class="text-white">2023</strong> with <strong class="text-white">Francesco Coppola Bove</strong>, a home studio,
          and a microphone. No label, no plan. Just the idea that funk and soul could be recorded
          at home and still sound right.
        </p>

        <p class="bio-para">
          <strong class="text-[var(--accent-primary)]">Groove at Home</strong> grew from a solo experiment
          into a collective. Today it involves over <strong class="text-white">120 musicians</strong> from
          across Italy and beyond: singers, keyboardists, brass players, guitarists, people who grew up
          listening to the same records and play like it. The project stays independent, and it shows.
        </p>

        <p class="bio-para">
          In summer 2025 we played our first festival date at the
          <strong class="text-white">Nocera Jazz Festival</strong>. Around the same time we began working
          in the studio with <strong class="text-[var(--accent-primary)]">Mario Biondi</strong>,
          <strong class="text-[var(--accent-primary)]">Arabella Rustico</strong> and
          <strong class="text-[var(--accent-primary)]">Francesca Tandoi</strong>, three of the most
          respected names in Italian jazz and soul.
        </p>

        <p class="bio-para">
          In early 2026 we took the project to Europe: <strong class="text-white">BIKO</strong> in Milan,
          <strong class="text-white">Crazy Coqs</strong> in London,
          <strong class="text-white">Das Wohnzimmer</strong> in Wiesbaden.
          Three nights in three cities. Each one sold out.
        </p>

        <p class="bio-para">
          This summer we joined the lineup at
          <strong class="text-[var(--accent-primary)]">Kroton Jazz Festival</strong>,
          one of the more established jazz stages in southern Italy, alongside names like
          Andrea Di Battista and Vincent Garcia. Three nights.
        </p>

        <p class="bio-para">
          From festival main stages to jazz club residencies, we bring the same obsessive
          attention to sound, arrangement, and the room. Every set is a living thing: music that breathes, a band that listens, and an audience that leaves wanting more.
        </p>

        <p class="bio-para">
          Off stage, the reach speaks for itself: <strong class="text-white">40,000+ followers</strong>
          on Instagram, a <strong class="text-white">5.75% engagement rate</strong> well above industry
          average, and a viral video at <strong class="text-white">500K views</strong>. A community
          that travels with us, wherever the music goes.
        </p>

        <p class="bio-para bio-para--closing">
          The first studio album comes in <strong class="text-[var(--accent-primary)]">2027</strong>.
          Several tracks are already road-tested live. We're not in a rush.
        </p>

        <!-- Bio stats row -->
        <div class="bio-stats-row mt-8">
          {[
            { value: '2023', label: 'Founded' },
            { value: '120+', label: 'Musicians' },
            { value: '3', label: 'Countries Toured' },
            { value: '20+', label: 'Live Shows' },
          ].map(s => (
            <div class="bio-stat">
              <div class="bio-stat-value">{s.value}</div>
              <div class="bio-stat-label">{s.label}</div>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Cinematic carousel -->
      <div class="bio-carousel-wrap reveal" style="animation-delay: 0.25s">

        <!-- Main image frame -->
        <div
          class="bio-carousel relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-[0_30px_80px_rgba(0,0,0,0.7)] border border-white/10"
          style="aspect-ratio: 4/5; max-height: 560px;"
        >
          {images.map((img, index) => (
            <div
              class={`carousel-slide absolute inset-0 ${index === 0 ? 'opacity-100' : 'opacity-0'} transition-opacity duration-1000`}
              data-slide-index={index}
            >
              <!-- Ken Burns on each active slide -->
              <Image
                src={img.src}
                alt={img.alt}
                class="carousel-img w-full h-full object-cover"
                loading={index === 0 ? 'eager' : 'lazy'}
                quality={75}
                format="webp"
                widths={[400, 800]}
                sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 40vw"
              />
            </div>
          ))}

          <!-- Gradient overlay on image -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/40 via-transparent to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>

          <!-- Corner accent -->
          <div class="absolute top-4 left-4 w-8 h-8 border-t-2 border-l-2 border-[var(--accent-primary)] opacity-60 rounded-tl-sm pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 w-8 h-8 border-b-2 border-r-2 border-[var(--accent-primary)] opacity-60 rounded-br-sm pointer-events-none"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Dots -->
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-2 mt-5">
          {images.map((_, index) => (
            <button
              class="carousel-dot w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white/25 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/50"
              data-dot-index={index}
              aria-label={`Photo ${index + 1}`}
            />
          ))}
        </div>

        <!-- Caption -->
        <p class="text-center text-xs text-[var(--text-tertiary)] mt-3 italic carousel-caption">
          A few moments from sessions and soundchecks
        </p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="vintage-divider" />

<script>
  /* ── Carousel with Ken Burns on active slide ── */
  const slides = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-slide');
  const dots   = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-dot');
  const imgs   = document.querySelectorAll('.carousel-img');

  let currentIndex = 0;
  const totalSlides = slides.length;
  const INTERVAL = 4200;

  function showSlide(index: number) {
    slides.forEach((slide, i) => {
      const el = slide as HTMLElement;
      el.classList.toggle('opacity-100', i === index);
      el.classList.toggle('opacity-0',   i !== index);
    });

    dots.forEach((dot, i) => {
      const el = dot as HTMLElement;
      if (i === index) {
        el.classList.remove('bg-white/25', 'w-2');
        el.classList.add('bg-[var(--accent-primary)]', 'w-6');
      } else {
        el.classList.remove('bg-[var(--accent-primary)]', 'w-6');
        el.classList.add('bg-white/25', 'w-2');
      }
    });

    /* Ken Burns: restart animation on the active image */
    imgs.forEach((img, i) => {
      const el = img as HTMLElement;
      if (i === index) {
        el.style.animation = 'none';
        void el.offsetHeight; // reflow
        el.style.animation = 'ken-burns 8s ease-in-out forwards';
      } else {
        el.style.animation = 'none';
      }
    });
  }

  function nextSlide() {
    currentIndex = (currentIndex + 1) % totalSlides;
    showSlide(currentIndex);
  }

  let autoplay = setInterval(nextSlide, INTERVAL);

  dots.forEach((dot, index) => {
    dot.addEventListener('click', () => {
      currentIndex = index;
      showSlide(currentIndex);
      clearInterval(autoplay);
      autoplay = setInterval(nextSlide, INTERVAL);
    });
  });

  const carousel = document.querySelector('.bio-carousel');
  carousel?.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => clearInterval(autoplay));
  carousel?.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { autoplay = setInterval(nextSlide, INTERVAL); });

  // Initialise first slide
  showSlide(0);
</script>

<style>
/* ── Bio text ── */
.bio-para {
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  line-height: 1.9;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
}

.bio-para--lead {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  color: white;
  font-style: italic;
  border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-primary);
  padding-left: 1rem;
  margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
  line-height: 1.75;
}

.bio-para--closing {
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
}

/* ── Stats row ── */
.bio-stats-row {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
  gap: 1rem;
  padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  border-radius: 1rem;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  background: var(--card-bg);
  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
}

/* 2×2 on small screens */
@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .bio-stats-row {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 1rem;
  }
}

.bio-stat {
  text-align: center;
}

.bio-stat-value {
  font-family: 'Space Grotesk', 'Inter', sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: var(--accent-primary);
  line-height: 1;
  margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
}

.bio-stat-label {
  font-size: 0.65rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  color: var(--text-tertiary);
  font-weight: 600;
}

/* ── Carousel dot transition ── */
.carousel-dot {
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

/* ── Ken Burns on carousel image ── */
.carousel-img {
  animation: ken-burns 8s ease-in-out forwards;
}
</style>
